{"about_the_game":"<strong>Made for VR. Memories feel closer here.</strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hidden Memories of The Gardens Between</i> is a tranquil single-player adventure-puzzle game about time, memory and friendship.\u00a0 With twice the content of the original, Hidden Memories invites you to unlock Arina's personal diary and solve 40+ new puzzles \u2014 woven seamlessly into a deeper, more intimate journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT'S NEW IN HIDDEN MEMORIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 40+ New Puzzles \u2013 Delightfully inventive puzzles designed exclusively for VR.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Vibrant Art Style \u2013 Beautiful, storybook-inspired islands that you can now visit yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f An Expanded Award-Winning Narrative \u2013 Delve deeper with Arina\u2019s illustrated diary offering new insights and perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Whimsical VR Interactions \u2013 Deepen your connection to the story with intuitive, hands-on gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Comfortably Immerse Yourself \u2013 Relax in serene islands seated or standing with no pressure, fail-states, or complex UI.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/96c4c2b644fdb3f18830b126eb78f9a2.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/96c4c2b644fdb3f18830b126eb78f9a2.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/96c4c2b644fdb3f18830b126eb78f9a2.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control time itself to solve puzzles built from the emotional architecture of memory.\u00a0 Move time with your hands as dreamlike islands revolve before you \u2014 each one a sculpted memory, built from the emotions and objects that shaped Arina and Frendt\u2019s past.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Manipulate time to solve puzzles and reach the apex of each isle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play retro video games, wield paintbrushes, and dig for dino bones at the museum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf8 Interact with objects to solve puzzles - from childhood toys to symbolic tools of self-expression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 Discover surreal dreamscapes where every detail carries emotional weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2611\ufe0f Playtime for most players: Roughly 4 - 8 hours depending on puzzle solving confidence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NARRATIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through Arina\u2019s evolving diary, experience the subtle, sometimes bittersweet shifts of a childhood bond growing older. Each island captures a turning point, a feeling, or a forgotten moment\u2014rendered in vivid color and texture. Explore themes of memory, growth, and the spaces between people.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deeper into the story through Arina's diary entries and artistic evolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the moments that defined their friendship\u2014and changed them forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the past with new perspective, in a world made to be felt as much as seen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/4b0d9c2ac49e551bda21b0febb909797.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/4b0d9c2ac49e551bda21b0febb909797.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/4b0d9c2ac49e551bda21b0febb909797.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACCOLADES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winner of 14 awards, including: 'Game of the Year', Webby 'Best Puzzles', and the 'Apple Design Award', as well as twenty more international nominations including IGF 'Excellence in Visual Art'.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Memories (VR) praised by press: 9/10 Gaming Trend, 8/10 , 8/10 GeekGasm, 8.5/10 The VR Realm, 8/10 Use A Potion, 8/10 IndieGames.eu, 7.5/10 PixelByteGaming, 8.5/10 MKAU Gaming.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Moving In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084870/18ce00db26e93646d08bedcd43e19fa4829a61b9.jpg"},{"name":"New Friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084870/2befc67461cf6107d51228f6a51e0d74b7c714a7.jpg"},{"name":"Staying Up Late","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084870/260a9a682a9940b5ba2021379db5f38b7a8f6c94.jpg"},{"name":"Our Secret Clubhouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084870/60624ce0042305ccdf7ff647955d38a2ab0d5541.jpg"},{"name":"Mischievous Discoveries","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084870/f271b39dbd2c40aad6ec150faee0bdb405108560.jpg"},{"name":"An Expedition Goes Down The Drain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084870/147fda9ba75de978af6bd6abb25f66e76079347f.jpg"},{"name":"Stargazing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084870/e28fd8f4302494cba1549d7c78eb50bd39047957.jpg"},{"name":"The Gardens Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084870/53bd1ae379af93bff35b0d0c2c531ccd3645e46f.jpg"},{"name":"Memento Mine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084870/3694f990c4d9067d77a777ece8e308fd32153edc.jpg"},{"name":"Things Fade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3084870/f49ea5b10b86be0f6e165a8cb46fdc0a9e0717c0.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084870?t=1758077750","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/6e513fb521082b30bcdf4de563254b88f2fb7e4b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758077750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/a351550279f1ae2f8ecfce73af3253821474b256/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758077750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/a351550279f1ae2f8ecfce73af3253821474b256/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758077750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Made for VR. Memories feel closer here.</strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hidden Memories of The Gardens Between</i> is a tranquil single-player adventure-puzzle game about time, memory and friendship.\u00a0 With twice the content of the original, Hidden Memories invites you to unlock Arina's personal diary and solve 40+ new puzzles \u2014 woven seamlessly into a deeper, more intimate journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/1903a442893eb113f64fac66e750c6e0.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT'S NEW IN HIDDEN MEMORIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 40+ New Puzzles \u2013 Delightfully inventive puzzles designed exclusively for VR.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Vibrant Art Style \u2013 Beautiful, storybook-inspired islands that you can now visit yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f An Expanded Award-Winning Narrative \u2013 Delve deeper with Arina\u2019s illustrated diary offering new insights and perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 Whimsical VR Interactions \u2013 Deepen your connection to the story with intuitive, hands-on gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Comfortably Immerse Yourself \u2013 Relax in serene islands seated or standing with no pressure, fail-states, or complex UI.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/96c4c2b644fdb3f18830b126eb78f9a2.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/96c4c2b644fdb3f18830b126eb78f9a2.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/96c4c2b644fdb3f18830b126eb78f9a2.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control time itself to solve puzzles built from the emotional architecture of memory.\u00a0 Move time with your hands as dreamlike islands revolve before you \u2014 each one a sculpted memory, built from the emotions and objects that shaped Arina and Frendt\u2019s past.\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Manipulate time to solve puzzles and reach the apex of each isle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play retro video games, wield paintbrushes, and dig for dino bones at the museum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddf8 Interact with objects to solve puzzles - from childhood toys to symbolic tools of self-expression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 Discover surreal dreamscapes where every detail carries emotional weight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2611\ufe0f Playtime for most players: Roughly 4 - 8 hours depending on puzzle solving confidence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/169c18c0fc5392fe3c581727248ff787.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NARRATIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through Arina\u2019s evolving diary, experience the subtle, sometimes bittersweet shifts of a childhood bond growing older. Each island captures a turning point, a feeling, or a forgotten moment\u2014rendered in vivid color and texture. Explore themes of memory, growth, and the spaces between people.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve deeper into the story through Arina's diary entries and artistic evolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the moments that defined their friendship\u2014and changed them forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the past with new perspective, in a world made to be felt as much as seen.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/4b0d9c2ac49e551bda21b0febb909797.poster.avif?t=1758077750\" width=450 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/4b0d9c2ac49e551bda21b0febb909797.webm?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/extras/4b0d9c2ac49e551bda21b0febb909797.mp4?t=1758077750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACCOLADES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winner of 14 awards, including: 'Game of the Year', Webby 'Best Puzzles', and the 'Apple Design Award', as well as twenty more international nominations including IGF 'Excellence in Visual Art'.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Memories (VR) praised by press: 9/10 Gaming Trend, 8/10 , 8/10 GeekGasm, 8.5/10 The VR Realm, 8/10 Use A Potion, 8/10 IndieGames.eu, 7.5/10 PixelByteGaming, 8.5/10 MKAU Gaming.</p></li></ul>","developers":["The Voxel Agents"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084870/9f134994682a04e8f598b7f3d0486a07d5e4f88b/header.jpg?t=1758077750","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"The Voxel Agents \u00a9 2025 ","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3084870/129259746/3e754e297cb95f2e746be19bb0e95374c16c5610/1754538634/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754568450","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3084870/129259746/3e754e297cb95f2e746be19bb0e95374c16c5610/175453